[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11880.71, "timestamp": "03:18:00", "text": "うん。私はそれを生で見て、そして"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11881.914, "timestamp": "03:18:01", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "WHAT"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11882.95, "timestamp": "03:18:02", "text": "みんな、彼女は200人くらいいたと思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11885.83, "timestamp": "03:18:05", "text": "当時Twitchで視聴していた視聴者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11889.349, "timestamp": "03:18:09", "text": "そして全員が口を揃えて「誰も」と言った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11891.99, "timestamp": "03:18:11", "text": "これについて話すつもりだ。誰もクリップしなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11894.429, "timestamp": "03:18:14", "text": "それ。誰も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11897.349, "timestamp": "03:18:17", "text": "スクリーンショット。みんなで一緒に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11899.429, "timestamp": "03:18:19", "text": "言ったように、これはデリケートな問題です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11901.75, "timestamp": "03:18:21", "text": "案件。私たちは尊重すべきではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11905.349, "timestamp": "03:18:25", "text": "この瞬間、誰も誰も誰もみんな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11907.51, "timestamp": "03:18:27", "text": "出てきて、よし、やらなきゃ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11911.429, "timestamp": "03:18:31", "text": "これは彼女のため、なぜなら私たちは彼女を愛しているから。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11911.588, "timestamp": "03:18:31", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "respectUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2AkUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/7cIfY5niDOmSkNAP08CA6A4"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11912.95, "timestamp": "03:18:32", "text": "そしてその時、私は「わかった」と思った。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11914.55, "timestamp": "03:18:34", "text": "このコミュニティには、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11916.63, "timestamp": "03:18:36", "text": "愚かではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11919.429, "timestamp": "03:18:39", "text": "ああ、それは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11921.91, "timestamp": "03:18:41", "text": "尊敬に値する。マジでヤバい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11924.71, "timestamp": "03:18:44", "text": "世界には尊敬する人々がいる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11927.19, "timestamp": "03:18:47", "text": "押"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11930.229, "timestamp": "03:18:50", "text": "他のユーチューバーやストリーマーも同様です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11933.11, "timestamp": "03:18:53", "text": "視聴者が200人または100人いる場合、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11935.75, "timestamp": "03:18:55", "text": "情報を漏洩したら、終わりだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11938.71, "timestamp": "03:18:58", "text": "はい。"}]